{"id":"n69125-1-7","stage":5,"title":"외양 · 外貌","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69125-1-7-1","ko":"건물이 번쩍번쩍한 게 정말 화려하다!","zh":"那栋建筑亮闪闪的，真是太华丽了！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"건물이","meaning":"建筑，建筑物","explanation":"건물：建筑，建筑物；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"건물","audio":"/audio/51a9489f74ea88e7bf4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28029","senseId":"1","lemma":"건물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건물이","audio":"/audio/9b76add0b81a2921f6f8.mp3"}},{"text":"번쩍번쩍한","meaning":"亮闪闪，闪亮","explanation":"번쩍번쩍하다：亮闪闪，闪亮；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"번쩍번쩍하다","audio":"/audio/4ed0cdd62101997222a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59108","senseId":"1","lemma":"번쩍번쩍하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"번쩍번쩍한","audio":"/audio/9950c242ab7f3c64b298.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"화려하다!","meaning":"华丽","explanation":"화려하다：华丽；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"화려하다","audio":"/audio/e44483c48cde72bc2261.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73229","senseId":"1","lemma":"화려하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화려하다","audio":"/audio/e44483c48cde72bc2261.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"51a9489f74ea88e7","term":"건물","zh":"建筑，建筑物","audio":"/audio/51a9489f74ea88e7bf4d.mp3","entryId":"28029","definition":"为住人、做事或保管东西而建造的有墙壁和屋顶的构造物。","pronunciation":["건ː물"]},{"id":"4ed0cdd621019972","term":"번쩍번쩍하다","zh":"亮闪闪，闪亮","audio":"/audio/4ed0cdd62101997222a5.mp3","entryId":"59108","definition":"亮光连续出现一会又消失；或指使其那样。","pronunciation":["번쩍뻔쩌카다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"e44483c48cde72bc","term":"화려하다","zh":"华丽","audio":"/audio/e44483c48cde72bc2261.mp3","entryId":"73229","definition":"美丽好看，明亮耀眼，看起来好。","pronunciation":["화려하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1c7a26127abd772f6e4c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69125-1-7-2","ko":"외양만 그렇지 안에 들어가면 별로 볼 게 없어.","zh":"只是外观如此，进去之后其实没什么可看的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"외양만","meaning":"外貌，外形，外观，外表","explanation":"외양：外貌，外形，外观，外表；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"외양","audio":"/audio/a2c5227cf54b6e68ee2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69125","senseId":"1","lemma":"외양","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"외양만","audio":"/audio/659045a14f6992541ebc.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇지","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇지","audio":"/audio/66da57bd505cc1e1c679.mp3"}},{"text":"안에","meaning":"里，里面","explanation":"안：里，里面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74890","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안에","audio":"/audio/3b4a5d602e7fd07a5b8d.mp3"}},{"text":"들어가면","meaning":"进，进去","explanation":"들어가다：进，进去；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"들어가다","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67877","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어가면","audio":"/audio/f57792efb4236e6783ab.mp3"}},{"text":"별로","meaning":"特别，格外","explanation":"별로：特别，格外","readings":[{"term":"별로","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58301","senseId":"1","lemma":"별로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"별로","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3"}},{"text":"볼","meaning":"看，看待","explanation":"보다：看，看待；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"4","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"볼","audio":"/audio/88585628a473f6dabc46.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"없어.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어","audio":"/audio/d3275bf98baed4550c12.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a2c5227cf54b6e68","term":"외양","zh":"外貌，外形，外观，外表","audio":"/audio/a2c5227cf54b6e68ee2b.mp3","entryId":"69125","definition":"表面显露出来的模样。","pronunciation":["외ː양","웨ː양"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"里，里面","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"74890","definition":"从某物体或空间的周围向着中间的方向；或指那样的部分。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"5a3b0d8b05ae781d","term":"들어가다","zh":"进，进去","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3","entryId":"67877","definition":"由外往里去。","pronunciation":["드러가다"]},{"id":"ebf90bac22cca4cd","term":"별로","zh":"特别，格外","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3","entryId":"58301","definition":"特殊额外地；或指那么不同地。","pronunciation":["별로"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，看待","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"认识并判断事件或情况。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不具有某物，或不具备资格、能力。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/adc5aa413107ed60bfbc.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.582,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69125","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":173,"sequenceScore":3.4087,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["只是外观如此，进去之后其实没什么可看的。","那栋建筑亮闪闪的，真是太华丽了！","裕敏的表现和以前不太一样呢。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那栋建筑亮闪闪的，真是太华丽了！","裕敏的表现和以前不太一样呢。","只是外观如此，进去之后其实没什么可看的。"],"answer":2}]}
